## Why This Is Asked
Probes event-sourced testing depth: end-to-end correctness, schema evolution, idempotence, and production-read rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Event contracts, backward/forward compatibility
- Projection idempotence and replay
- Drift detection and backfill strategies
- Snapshotting, data loss, rollback criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-test showing replay of events and projection verification
async function testProjectionOnReplay(store, projection) {
  await store.truncateAll();
  await store.emit([/* sample events */]);
  await projection.refresh();
  const model = await projection.query();
  assert.equal(model.total, expectedTotal);
}
```

